{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33978","headline":"夏景无事因怀章来二上人二首 二 · 皮日休","name":"夏景无事因怀章来二上人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳树盘珊枕草堂，此中随分亦闲忙。\n平铺风簟寻琴谱，静扫烟窗着药方。\n幽鸟见贫留好语，白莲知卧送清香。\n从今有计消闲日，更爲支公置一牀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}